NOTE: This file is compatible with Microsoft Excel version 2002 and above.
If you have an earlier version then you must convert this file to a file format compatible with your Excel version.
To do this, we would suggest that you do the following:
- Download and install OpenOffice (http://download.openoffice.org/). This product is free and can coexist with Microsoft Office.
- Save the extracted Excel file (as text file) to the disk. The default file extension '.xls' should be changed to '.xml'.
- Use OpenOffice 'Calc' to open the saved Excel file by specifying the file type 'Microsoft Excel 2003 XML (*.xml)'.
- Save the file to a new file with a type corresponding to your own version of Excel.
